，想喝水自己穿好拖鞋。敢让我回来看到你光脚踩地板，今晚你那句“香菜”喊破喉咙都没用。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:21","timestamp":1780240914943,"roundId":"round_1780240876256_zmd1vc45a","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18598},{"id":1780239469322,"text":"你好烦","sender":"me","time":"23:22","timestamp":1780240968373,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18599},{"id":1780239469323,"text":"行","sender":"me","time":"23:22","timestamp":1780240976065,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18600},{"id":1780239469324,"text":"这个汤我需要看着吗","sender":"me","time":"23:23","timestamp":1780240990471,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18601},{"id":1780239469325,"text":"多久关","sender":"me","time":"23:23","timestamp":1780241002350,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18602},{"id":1780239469326,"text":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.1, Valence:0.8, Past:0.8, Present:0.9, Future:0.8 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"陆驰撑着黑伞走在Bloomsbury的雨夜里，路灯把雨丝照得像细密的银线。他看着手机，手指在屏幕上快速敲击。\"}","rawContent":"<STATE> V_energy:0.8, Resistance:0.1, Valence:0.8, Past:0.8, Present:0.9, Future:0.8 </STATE>{\"t\":\"state\",\"c\":\"陆驰撑着黑伞走在Bloomsbury的雨夜里，路灯把雨丝照得像细密的银线。他看着手机，手指在屏幕上快速敲击。\"}","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:23","timestamp":1780241017103,"roundId":"round_1780241004945_slyqpn0vu","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":18603},{"id":1780239469327,"text":"不需要你看。我已经调成最小火了，定好了时，等我回来刚刚好。","rawContent":"不需要你看。我已经调成最小火了，定好了时，等我回来刚刚好。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:23","timestam